<!--
  Debug entitlements: the same as App.entitlements minus time-sensitive notifications,
  which personal (free) development teams cannot provision. Debug builds can then be
  installed on a phone with any Apple ID. Without the entitlement iOS delivers the
  "Mic paused, tap to resume" alert at the .active level (it does not break through
  Focus); Release keeps App.entitlements.
-->
